        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/e7f23aaf01d4d58f9a5ffd03837452b7.webp?t=1782659048\" width=607 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outrun the swarm. Slam through enemies at full speed. Become a legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the galaxy? Boring. <strong>You want the fame.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Arc Galaxy is a flawless utopia, obsessed with perfection and terrified of anything that breaks the pattern. That is where you come in. Play as <strong>Dylo</strong>, a glory-hungry rebel, in a fast, arcade-style arena <strong>shooter</strong> where speed is the only thing keeping you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on a thumping <strong>synthwave</strong> soundtrack and the spirit of the old arcades: blast the Shadows, feed your ego, and tear down the lie behind the perfect world. Standing still gets you killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/04f171763f88a88356933d42468b1c11.poster.avif?t=1782659048\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/04f171763f88a88356933d42468b1c11.webm?t=1782659048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/04f171763f88a88356933d42468b1c11.mp4?t=1782659048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/15762fb5cc5412e96165246a2e92b83b.webp?t=1782659048\" width=607 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not just a pilot. You are the thing the perfect world cannot control. Survival means mastering systems that reward aggression and punish hesitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Speed is your weapon</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge your dash to blinding velocity, cross the arena in an instant, and detonate a shockwave on impact. The faster you move, the harder you hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Control the chaos</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies swarm in numbers. Use shockwaves to blow them back, clear space, and turn a corner-trap into a kill. Never stop moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fight for your reputation</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is graded on how well you fight. Play sloppy and you are nobody. Play clean and earn the top ranks. Glory is the whole point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A galaxy that fights back</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty watches you. Dominate and it hits harder. Struggle and it backs off. The fight evolves to match your skill, so it is never too easy and never unfair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Allies, when it gets ugly</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work alone until the chaos spirals out of control. Then backup drops in to fight at your side and cover your blind spots. Just do not let them steal your kills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>No luck, only skill</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no random crutches here. Only reflexes, muscle memory, and the perfect dash at the perfect moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/0cb76e08fbf9169b84ee16b02d629121.webp?t=1782659048\" width=607 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/ff725def1cab38478bb045b5a9c749a4.poster.avif?t=1782659048\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/ff725def1cab38478bb045b5a9c749a4.webm?t=1782659048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/ff725def1cab38478bb045b5a9c749a4.mp4?t=1782659048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The utopia is beautiful, and it is a cage. Fight across distinct <strong>planets</strong>, from sun-drenched golden beaches to the suffocating depths of ancient, moss-covered forests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong>sector</strong> is its own battlefield, with its own hazards and its own piece of the story. You are not here to sightsee. You are here to break the order and dig up what the &quot;perfect&quot; surface is hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/8c8a4e65325318efe377fa5880831050.webp?t=1782659048\" width=607 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/3ee7b47b400460b80b03c6ce5b2f142b.avif?t=1782659048\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras_big/3ee7b47b400460b80b03c6ce5b2f142b.webp?t=1782659048 width=1600 height=651 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dylo is no clean-cut hero. He is rude, reckless, and ruled by emotion in a world that runs on cold logic. But he is not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of misfits fights alongside him, all of them trying to feel something real in a galaxy that is falling apart. There is <strong>Orbo</strong>, the loyal Golden Retriever who keeps him grounded, and the allies who refuse to let his ego run the show. In a war for the soul of the galaxy, those connections are the only thing keeping Dylo human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/76644089addf840ad4c7e5952e2092f8.avif?t=1782659048\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras_big/76644089addf840ad4c7e5952e2092f8.webp?t=1782659048 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>",
